        "/api/v1/payments": {
            "post": {
                "operationId": "v1_payments_create",
                "description": "`POST /api/v1/payments` (spec: payment-processing, \"Payment Initiation\").\n\nCreates a `Payment` row scoped to the caller's app (via the requested\nSubscription, which is scoped by `customer__app`) and asks the\nconfigured `PaymentGateway` to create a charge for it. The gateway's\n`checkout_url` (which may carry a QR payload, per the spike — the SDK\ndoes not parse or guarantee a separate `qr_payload` field, see\nsdd/payments-microservice/spike-pagopar finding (a)) is returned as-is;\nthis service does not attempt to render or interpret it.",
                "tags": [
                    "v1"
                ],
                "security": [
                    {
                        "ApiKeyAuth": []
                    },
                    {
                        "cookieAuth": []
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "No response body"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
